pired fan game!\n\nJoin a thriving community of players in an ever-evolving world where updates drop weekly \u2014 sometimes even daily! Whether you're here to tag, explore, or create, I Am Gorilla has something for everyone.\n\n\ud83c\udfad Customize Your Gorilla\nChoose from 80+ unique cosmetics (and growing!) \u2014 from seasonal styles to wild, creative fits. Express yourself your way!\n\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Creator & Sandbox Tools\nBuild, explore, and experiment in Sandbox Mode and try out our Creator Tools \u2014 perfect for custom maps, fun experiments, or horror-level builds.\n\n\ud83d\udea8 Report Cheaters In-Game\nKeep the game fair and fun with built-in reporting tools to stop cheaters in their tracks.\n\n\ud83d\udcac Active Community & Socials\nWe're always listening. Join our active community, follow us on socials, and become part of something big.", "short_description": "Welcome to I Am Gorilla, the next big gorilla tag inspired fan game, we have a good community and are active on our socials, we update the game every week, sometimes every day"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://pastebin.com/dwA0AjLa", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SunVrr", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://pastebin.com/dwA0AjLa", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes"